category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "High-quality QR Code generator library (utilities)"
ldesc: "This project aims to be the best, clearest QR Code generator library in
multiple languages. The primary goals are flexible options and absolute
correctness. Secondary goals are compact implementation size and good
documentation comments."
